{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51350","headline":"三伤颂 · 伏牛上人","name":"三伤颂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"（斯五五五八卷录此诗，题作「龙兴寺香严和尚《嗟世三伤吟》」。\n香严和尚法名智闲，青州人，住持邓州香严山，梁乾化中卒。\n《宜堂集》卷十九、《宋高僧传》卷十三有传。\n该卷存前二首，其一爲「伤嗟啜刀鸟」，其三爲「伤嗟垒巢燕」，异文较多，校如次。\n校文中均以「一作某」代指该卷。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"伏牛上人","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51350.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51350","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}